---
// Gatekeeper bypass instructions for macOS users
// TODO: Delete this entire component when Apple notarization is complete
---

<div class="apple-platform-notice">
  <input type="checkbox" id="show-macos-help" class="visibility-controller" />
  
  <label for="show-macos-help" class="question-prompt">
    <svg class="prompt-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke-width="2"/>
      <path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </svg>
    <span class="prompt-text">Mac refusing to launch LifeVault?</span>
    <svg class="expand-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
      <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>
  </label>

  <div class="help-content-area">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
      
      <section class="why-blocked-section">
        <h3 class="section-heading">What's happening?</h3>
        <div class="explanation-blocks">
          <p class="explanation-paragraph">
            Apple's <strong>Gatekeeper</strong> security mechanism prevents launching apps that 
            haven't been verified via their notarization system. Since LifeVault isn't notarized yet 
            (a common situation for indie apps), your Mac will initially refuse to open it.
          </p>
          <p class="explanation-paragraph">
            This warning is <em>expected</em> and doesn't indicate danger—just that we're an 
            independent developer who hasn't gone through Apple's verification program yet.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="visual-break"></div>

      <section class="solution-section">
        <h3 class="section-heading">Installation process</h3>
        
        <div class="process-timeline">
          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="step-marker marker-one">①</div>
            <div class="step-details">
              <p class="step-text">Grab the DMG file from the download button</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="step-marker marker-two">②</div>
            <div class="step-details">
              <p class="step-text">Mount the DMG and drag LifeVault to your Applications directory</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="step-marker marker-three">③</div>
            <div class="step-details">
              <p class="step-text">If Gatekeeper prevents launch, here's the workaround:</p>
              <div class="substeps-container">
                <div class="substep">→ Launch Finder and navigate to Applications</div>
                <div class="substep">→ Locate LifeVault and perform a right-click (or Ctrl+click)</div>
                <div class="substep">→ Pick "Open" from the contextual menu</div>
                <div class="substep">→ In the warning dialog, select "Open" once more</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="step-marker marker-complete">✓</div>
            <div class="step-details">
              <p class="step-text"><strong>All set!</strong> This workaround is only needed on first launch.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cli-alternative-section">
        <input type="checkbox" id="reveal-cli" class="cli-toggle" />
        <label for="reveal-cli" class="cli-label">
          <span class="disclosure-marker">►</span>
          <span class="cli-label-text">Command-line approach (for developers)</span>
        </label>
        
        <div class="cli-content">
          <div class="cli-block">
            <p class="cli-intro">Terminal users can strip the quarantine attribute:</p>
            <div class="command-display">
              <code class="shell-command">xattr -cr /Applications/LifeVault.app</code>
            </div>
            <p class="cli-note">We suggest the GUI method for most people.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="status-banner">
        <svg class="banner-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <p class="banner-message">
          Notarization is planned. When completed, these instructions become obsolete.
        </p>
      </aside>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .apple-platform-notice {
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
  }

  .visibility-controller {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .question-prompt {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(var(--in) / 0.06), hsl(var(--in) / 0.02));
    border: 1.5px solid hsl(var(--in) / 0.2);
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .question-prompt:hover {
    border-color: hsl(var(--in) / 0.4);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(var(--in) / 0.1), hsl(var(--in) / 0.04));
  }

  .prompt-icon {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    stroke: hsl(var(--in));
  }

  .prompt-text {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .expand-arrow {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    stroke: currentColor;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .visibility-controller:checked ~ .question-prompt .expand-arrow {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .help-content-area {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.4s ease-out;
  }

  .visibility-controller:checked ~ .help-content-area {
    max-height: 2000px;
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: hsl(var(--b1));
    border: 1.5px solid hsl(var(--bc) / 0.1);
    border-top: none;
    border-radius: 0 0 0.625rem 0.625rem;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc));
  }

  .explanation-blocks {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .explanation-paragraph {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.8);
  }

  .visual-break {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, hsl(var(--bc) / 0.15), transparent);
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .process-timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .timeline-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .step-marker {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .marker-one,
  .marker-two,
  .marker-three {
    background: hsl(var(--p));
    color: hsl(var(--pc));
  }

  .marker-complete {
    background: hsl(var(--su));
    color: hsl(var(--suc));
  }

  .step-details {
    flex: 1;
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .step-text {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.8);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .substeps-container {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid hsl(var(--p) / 0.25);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .substep {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.7);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .cli-alternative-section {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cli-toggle {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cli-label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.55);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .cli-label:hover {
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.8);
  }

  .disclosure-marker {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .cli-toggle:checked ~ .cli-label .disclosure-marker {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
  }

  .cli-content {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
  }

  .cli-toggle:checked ~ .cli-content {
    max-height: 500px;
  }

  .cli-block {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: hsl(var(--b2) / 0.5);
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--bc) / 0.1);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cli-intro {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .command-display {
    background: hsl(var(--n));
    color: hsl(var(--nc));
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .shell-command {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'Cascadia Code', 'Source Code Pro', Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .cli-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.6);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .status-banner {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.875rem;
    background: hsl(var(--in) / 0.1);
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--in) / 0.25);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .banner-icon {
    width: 1.125rem;
    height: 1.125rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    stroke: hsl(var(--in));
    margin-top: 0.125rem;
  }

  .banner-message {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.75);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .expand-arrow,
    .disclosure-marker,
    .help-content-area,
    .cli-content {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  .question-prompt:focus-within {
    outline: 2px solid hsl(var(--p));
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
</style>
